flowchart TD
 A[/Enter quantity/]
 B{Fresh stock available?}
 C[/Show no-stock error/]
 D[(Save reduced stock)]
 E{Save order succeeds?}
 F([Stock stays reduced no new order])
 G[Pending reservation]
 H{Admin action?}
 I[Approve then claim]
 J[Cancel / reject restore stock]
 K([Completed])
 L([Cancelled / Rejected])
 A --> B
 B -- No --> C
 B -- Yes --> D
 D --> E
 E -- No --> F
 E -- Yes --> G
 G --> H
 H -- Approve --> I
 I -- Claim --> K
 H -- Reverse --> J
 J --> L